{"name":"Cappuccino Cosmico","hex":"#e1ddcd","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cappuccino","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An Italian coffee-based beverage made from espresso to which milk that has been steamed or frothed is added.","A cup of this beverage."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cappuccino"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cosmic latte","blocks":[{"text":"Cosmic latte is the average color of the galaxies of the universe as perceived by a typical human observer from the position of the Earth. In 2002, astronomers Karl Glazebrook and Ivan Baldry from Johns Hopkins University determined that the average color of the universe was a whiteish green. Still, they soon corrected their analysis in a 2003 paper in which they reported that their survey of the light from over 200,000 galaxies averaged to a whiteish beige. The hex triplet value for the cosmic latte color is approximately #FFF8E7."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cosmic_latte","wikidata":"Q2510690"},{"title":"Cappuccino","blocks":[{"text":"Cappuccino is an espresso-based coffee drink traditionally prepared with steamed milk, including a layer of milk foam."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/Cappuccino_in_original.jpg/330px-Cappuccino_in_original.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cappuccino","wikidata":"Q159774"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Bled_%285081159596%29.jpg/500px-Bled_%285081159596%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Bled_%285081159596%29.jpg/1280px-Bled_%285081159596%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Bled_%285081159596%29.jpg/500px-Bled_%285081159596%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wiki